            "godsLove": "This verse beautifully shows God’s love for us through the importance of relationships. Just as John wants to connect personally with his friends, God desires the same intimate connection with us. He is always present and ready to listen, offering us peace and comfort. God understands the value of community, and He surrounds us with friends and loved ones to encourage us in our journey. Even when we feel alone or distant, God is there, inviting us to draw near to Him and to one another, reminding us that we are never truly alone in this life.",
